    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHEEP </strong>is a<strong> challenging, surreal first-person herding adventure</strong> that takes you through pastures, mountains, space, and pocket dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.poster.avif?t=1751941254\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.webm?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.mp4?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc11 Lead Your Flock \u2013 Control Woolsworth to guide your flock. Use clever movement and positioning to solve puzzles and traverse treacherous terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Gain Magic Abilities - Find hidden crystals to unlock powerful new moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Challenging encounters - Fast-paced fights that reward sharp reflexes and clever use of your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Explore the Surreal - From grassy hills to rainy chasms, lava caverns, and starry arenas\u2014each level is a strange new world with its own secrets and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Uncover Hidden Realms - Secret access points transport you to six optional levels full of traps, puzzles, and battles\u2014including a chaotic finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**All side levels include a built in timer and best time bulletin board.<strong> WELCOME SPEEDRUNNERS!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Original Soundtrack - Let a playful, emotional score carry you through each strange new world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.poster.avif?t=1751941254\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.webm?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.mp4?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.poster.avif?t=1751941254\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.webm?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.mp4?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.poster.avif?t=1751941254\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.webm?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.mp4?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/383ff537682dfb2d03af97a30c2dc1cc.poster.avif?t=1751941254\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/383ff537682dfb2d03af97a30c2dc1cc.webm?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/383ff537682dfb2d03af97a30c2dc1cc.mp4?t=1751941254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
